---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Personal Injury Attorney | Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in an accident? Sulfab Law Office fights for compensation in personal injury cases throughout San Francisco. Call (415) 360-5266."
  canonical="/personal-injury-lawyer-san-francisco/"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <img src="/assets/images/personal-injury-hero.png" alt="" class="hero-bg-img" loading="eager" />
      <div class="hero-bg-overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-gold-bar"></div>
        <span class="hero-page-label">Practice Area</span>
        <h1 class="hero-page-title">Personal Injury Lawyer in San Francisco, CA</h1>
        <p class="hero-page-subtitle">An unexpected accident can change your life in a matter of seconds. Whether you've been injured in a <a href="/car-accidents-lawyer-san-francisco/" class="text-gold hover:underline">car accident</a>, a <a href="/slip-and-fall-lawyer-san-francisco/" class="text-gold hover:underline">slip and fall</a>, a construction accident, or another incident caused by someone else's negligence, the physical, emotional, and financial consequences can be overwhelming. Medical bills begin to accumulate, lost wages create additional stress, and dealing with insurance companies often becomes another frustrating challenge.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="btn-primary">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline">Free Case Evaluation</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-intro-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-intro-content">
        <p>At <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=17320769596054478689" class="text-gold font-semibold hover:underline">The Sulfab Law Office</a>, we understand the difficulties injury victims face after a serious accident. Our goal is to provide compassionate legal guidance while aggressively protecting your rights throughout every stage of your personal injury claim. As a trusted Personal Injury Lawyer in San Francisco, we are committed to helping individuals and families pursue fair compensation so they can focus on healing and rebuilding their lives.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="strategic-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="strategic-grid">
        <div class="strategic-sidebar">
          <p class="kicker">Experience Matters</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading">Dedicated Personal Injury Representation You Can Trust</h2>
          <div class="gold-bar"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="strategic-content">
          <p>Recovering from an injury is difficult enough without having to navigate California's complex legal system on your own. Insurance companies often prioritize protecting their profits over fairly compensating accident victims. They may delay claims, dispute liability, or offer settlements that fail to cover the full extent of your damages.</p>
          <p>When you work with The Sulfab Law Office, you gain an advocate who is focused on protecting your best interests. We carefully evaluate every case, investigate the facts, gather supporting evidence, and negotiate with insurance companies on your behalf. If necessary, we are fully prepared to pursue your case through litigation to seek the compensation you deserve.</p>
          <div class="strategic-highlight">
            <p>Every personal injury case is different, which is why we take the time to understand your unique circumstances and develop a legal strategy tailored to your needs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-grid-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="services-grid-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Types of Cases</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Types of Personal Injury Cases We Handle</h2>
        <p class="services-subtitle">Our firm represents clients throughout San Francisco and the surrounding Bay Area in a wide variety of personal injury matters.</p>
        <div class="services-detail-grid">
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/car-accidents-lawyer-san-francisco/" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Car Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>Car accidents remain one of the leading causes of serious injuries in California. Whether your collision occurred on Highway 101, Interstate 280, city streets, or residential neighborhoods, we work to establish liability and pursue compensation for your injuries, medical expenses, vehicle damage, and lost income.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/truck-accidents-lawyer-san-francisco/" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Truck Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>Commercial truck accidents often involve severe injuries due to the size and weight of tractor-trailers. These cases can involve multiple responsible parties, including trucking companies, drivers, maintenance providers, and manufacturers. We conduct thorough investigations to determine liability.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/motorcycle-accidents-lawyer-san-francisco/" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Motorcycle Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>Motorcyclists are especially vulnerable to catastrophic injuries. Our firm works to protect injured riders from unfair assumptions and insurance company tactics while pursuing maximum compensation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Bicycle and <a href="/pedestrian-injuries-lawyer-san-francisco/" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Pedestrian Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>San Francisco's busy streets are shared by vehicles, cyclists, and pedestrians. Unfortunately, distracted driving and failure to yield often result in devastating accidents. We represent injured cyclists and pedestrians seeking justice after preventable collisions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/slip-and-fall-lawyer-san-francisco/" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Slip and Fall Accidents</a></h3>
            <p>Property owners have a legal duty to maintain reasonably safe premises. Dangerous conditions such as wet floors, broken stairways, uneven sidewalks, or inadequate lighting may lead to serious injuries. We help victims pursue premises liability claims against negligent property owners.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Dog Bite Injuries</h3>
            <p>Dog attacks can result in significant physical injuries, emotional trauma, and permanent scarring. California law provides important protections for dog bite victims, and we help clients understand their legal options.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3>Construction Accidents</h3>
            <p>Construction sites contain numerous hazards that may lead to serious injuries. Whether your accident involved defective equipment, unsafe working conditions, or negligence by another contractor, we work to protect your legal rights.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-detail-item">
            <h3><a href="/wrongful-death-lawyer-san-francisco/" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Wrongful Death Claims</a></h3>
            <p>Losing a loved one because of another person's negligence is devastating. We assist surviving family members in pursuing wrongful death claims to seek compensation for funeral expenses, financial losses, and the emotional impact of their loss.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cards-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cards-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Legal Framework</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Understanding Personal Injury Law in California</h2>
        <p class="cards-subtitle">Most personal injury cases are based on negligence. Negligence occurs when an individual or organization fails to exercise reasonable care, causing harm to another person.</p>
        <div class="cards-grid">
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Establishing a Claim</h3>
            <p>To establish a successful claim, it is generally necessary to demonstrate: The responsible party owed you a duty of care, that duty was breached through negligent actions or inaction, the breach directly caused your injuries, and you suffered measurable damages as a result.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>Comparative Negligence</h3>
            <p>California follows a comparative negligence rule, which means compensation may still be available even if you were partially responsible for the accident. Determining liability often requires a careful investigation, witness interviews, accident reconstruction, medical records, and expert analysis.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="compensation-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="compensation-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Financial Recovery</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Compensation Available After a Serious Injury</h2>
        <p class="compensation-subtitle">A personal injury claim seeks to recover financial compensation for the losses caused by another party's negligence. Depending on your case, you may be entitled to recover compensation for:</p>
        <div class="compensation-grid">
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Medical Expenses</h3>
            <p>Medical costs often continue long after the initial emergency treatment. Compensation may include hospital bills, surgeries, medications, rehabilitation, physical therapy, specialist care, and future medical treatment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Lost Income</h3>
            <p>If your injuries prevent you from working, you may recover compensation for lost wages as well as future loss of earning capacity if your ability to work has been permanently affected.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Pain and Suffering</h3>
            <p>Serious injuries often create lasting physical pain, emotional distress, anxiety, depression, and a reduced quality of life. These non-economic damages are an important part of many personal injury claims.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Property Damage</h3>
            <p>If your vehicle or other personal property was damaged during the accident, you may recover repair or replacement costs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="compensation-item">
            <span class="compensation-icon">
              <svg class="lucide" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </span>
            <h3>Wrongful Death Compensation</h3>
            <p>Families who lose a loved one due to negligence may be eligible to seek compensation for funeral expenses, loss of financial support, and other damages recognized under California law.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-us-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="why-us-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Time Matters</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Why Acting Quickly Matters</h2>
        <div class="why-us-subtitle-content">
          <p>Time is critical after any serious accident.</p>
          <p>Important evidence can disappear quickly, surveillance footage may be deleted, accident scenes change, and witnesses' memories naturally fade. California also places legal deadlines on filing personal injury claims.</p>
          <p>Seeking legal guidance early allows your attorney to preserve evidence, communicate with insurance companies, interview witnesses, and build the strongest possible case before valuable information is lost.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-us-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="why-us-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Why Choose Us</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Why Choose The Sulfab Law Office?</h2>
        <p class="why-us-subtitle">Choosing the right attorney can make a significant difference in the outcome of your case. At The Sulfab Law Office, we believe every client deserves personal attention, honest communication, and experienced legal representation. We understand that every injury affects people differently, and we take the time to understand your goals before developing a legal strategy.</p>
        <p class="why-us-subtitle">Our clients appreciate our commitment to:</p>
        <div class="why-us-grid">
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Personalized legal representation</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Clear and responsive communication</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Thorough case preparation</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Aggressive negotiation with insurance companies</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Strategic legal advocacy</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Compassionate client service</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="why-us-item">
            <h3>Protecting your rights throughout the legal process</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="why-us-subtitle" style="margin-top: 2rem;">We are dedicated to helping injury victims throughout San Francisco pursue fair compensation while providing guidance during one of the most challenging times in their lives.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cards-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cards-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Our Process</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Our Legal Process</h2>
        <p class="cards-subtitle">When you contact The Sulfab Law Office, we guide you through every stage of your case. Our process includes:</p>
        <div class="cards-grid cards-grid-7">
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>1. Initial Case Evaluation</h3>
            <p>We review the details of your accident and injuries to determine the best course of action for your claim.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>2. Investigation and Evidence Collection</h3>
            <p>Our team conducts thorough investigations, gathers evidence, and consults with experts to build a strong case.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>3. Review of Medical Records</h3>
            <p>We carefully review your medical records to understand the full extent of your injuries and treatment needs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>4. Communication with Insurance Companies</h3>
            <p>We handle all communication with insurance companies to protect your rights and prevent unfair settlements.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>5. Settlement Negotiations</h3>
            <p>We pursue settlement negotiations on your behalf to seek fair compensation for your injuries and losses.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>6. Litigation if Necessary</h3>
            <p>If a fair settlement cannot be reached, we are fully prepared to take your case to court.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-item">
            <h3>7. Resolution Through Settlement or Trial</h3>
            <p>Whether through settlement negotiations or trial, we work to achieve the best possible outcome for your case. Throughout the process, we keep you informed and answer your questions so you always understand the status of your case.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faq-content">
        <p class="kicker text-center">Questions & Answers</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <div class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>What should I do after a personal injury accident in San Francisco?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>After an accident, your health should be your first priority. Seek immediate medical attention, even if your injuries seem minor. Report the incident to the appropriate authorities, gather evidence such as photos and witness information if possible, and avoid discussing fault with insurance companies before speaking with an attorney. Consulting a personal injury lawyer early can help protect your legal rights.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>How long do I have to file a personal injury claim in California?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>California law sets time limits for filing personal injury claims, known as the statute of limitations. However, the deadline can vary depending on the circumstances of your case. Speaking with an experienced attorney as soon as possible helps ensure important deadlines are not missed.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>How much is my personal injury case worth?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Every personal injury case is unique. The value of your claim depends on factors such as the severity of your injuries, medical expenses, lost income, future treatment needs, pain and suffering, and the overall impact the accident has had on your life.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>What types of compensation can I recover?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Depending on your case, you may be eligible to recover compensation for: medical expenses, lost wages, future medical treatment, reduced earning capacity, pain and suffering, emotional distress, property damage, and wrongful death damages (when applicable).</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>What if I was partially responsible for the accident?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>California follows a comparative negligence system. In some situations, you may still be able to recover compensation even if you were partially at fault. An attorney can evaluate your case and explain how liability may affect your potential recovery.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>Do I need a personal injury lawyer?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>While you are not legally required to hire an attorney, having experienced legal representation can help level the playing field when dealing with insurance companies. A lawyer can investigate your claim, gather evidence, negotiate on your behalf, and pursue the compensation you deserve.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>Will my personal injury case go to court?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Many personal injury claims are resolved through settlement negotiations. However, if a fair settlement cannot be reached, your attorney may recommend taking the case to court to pursue the compensation you deserve.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>How long does a personal injury case take?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>The timeline varies depending on the complexity of the case, the severity of the injuries, the amount of evidence involved, and whether the case settles or proceeds to trial. Some cases resolve within months, while others require more time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>What evidence is important in a personal injury case?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Helpful evidence may include: medical records, accident reports, photographs, witness statements, surveillance footage, repair estimates, expert opinions, and documentation of lost wages. Strong evidence helps establish liability and supports your claim for compensation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
              <span>Why should I choose The Sulfab Law Office?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>The Sulfab Law Office is committed to providing personalized legal representation for injury victims throughout San Francisco. We focus on protecting our clients' rights, maintaining clear communication, thoroughly preparing every case, and pursuing fair compensation through strategic legal advocacy.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <div class="cta-glow"></div>
        <div class="cta-content">
          <div class="cta-text">
            <h2>Speak With a Personal Injury Lawyer in San Francisco Today</h2>
            <p>If you or someone you love has been injured because of another person's negligence, you should not have to face the legal process alone. Seeking experienced legal representation early can help protect your rights and improve your ability to pursue full compensation.</p>
            <p>At <strong>The Sulfab Law Office</strong>, we are committed to helping injury victims throughout San Francisco obtain the legal guidance they need after a serious accident. Whether your injuries resulted from a motor vehicle collision, unsafe property conditions, or another act of negligence, our team is ready to evaluate your case and discuss your legal options.</p>
            <p><strong>Contact <a href="/" class="text-gold hover:underline">The Sulfab Law Office</a> today to <a href="/#contact" class="text-gold hover:underline">schedule a consultation</a> with an experienced Personal Injury Lawyer in San Francisco and take the first step toward protecting your future.</strong></p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="btn-cta">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
            <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline">Schedule a Consultation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
    .hero-bg-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; }
    .hero-bg-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(15,23,42,0.92) 0%, rgba(15,23,42,0.75) 50%, rgba(15,23,42,0.4) 100%); }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    .services-detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .services-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
    .service-detail-item { padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-radius: 0.75rem; background-color: rgba(248,250,252,0.5); }
    .service-detail-item h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    .service-detail-item p { color: #475569; font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

    .cards-grid-7 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .cards-grid-7 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }
    .cards-grid-7 .card-item:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

    .why-us-subtitle-content { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; }
    .why-us-subtitle-content p { color: #475569; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    .why-us-subtitle-content p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .faq-section { padding: 4rem 0; background-color: #fff; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { .faq-section { padding: 5rem 0; } }
    .faq-content { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; }
    .faq-list { margin-top: 3rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .faq-item { border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-radius: 1rem; overflow: hidden; background-color: rgba(248,250,252,0.5); }
    .faq-question {
      width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
